Package: kf6-pulseaudio-qt
Version: @DEB_PULSEAUDIOQT_V@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <max@maxleiter.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, libpulse0, libglib2.0-0
Description: Qt wrapper library for PulseAudio used by KDE Plasma
 PulseAudioQt provides KF6::PulseAudioQt and the C++ models consumed by
 Plasma's volume applet.
